                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00018         * Further provenance is unknown but there has been at *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00019         * least some modifications by Marie-Louis Marcoux.    *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00020         * The program now reports position in the allocation  *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00021         * map and which sectors the bytes represent when      *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00022         * editing the map. It appears to also contain the     *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00023         * patches indicated below.                            *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00024         * The Rev Ed is 2.05 which would be consistant with   *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00025         * the Marcoux dEd on RTSI as dEd_Plus_1and2_Patch.lzh *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00026         * but the CRC does not match. RG                      *
