                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00031         * 02/88 -Added "enter" command which cleans up the    *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00032         *        screen by running the REDO subroutine. (RAK) *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00033         *                                                     *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00034         * 01/90 -Added a check for the break key which allows *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00035         *        aborting the <F>ind function. (RAK)          *
                      (vel1/cmds/ded.asm):00036         *       -Added a check for null filename in OUTFILE:  *
